#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../README.md:45
#, markdown-text
msgid "Stable installation:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:48
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Clone the whole repo, then run `./configure`. Add `--without-doc` flag "
"if you don't have `asciidoctor`,\n"
"    and add `--without-i18n` flag if you don't have `gettext` package.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:57
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```sh\n"
"    git clone https://github.com/ceccomp/ceccomp.git\n"
"    cd Ceccomp\n"
"    ./configure\n"
"    ./configure # run this again if Makefile is not generated\n"
"    make\n"
"    make install # install at /usr/bin\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: ../README.md:59
#, markdown-text
msgid "Testing installation:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:61
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "    Clone the whole repo, and then run `./configure --devmode`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:68
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```sh\n"
"    git clone https://github.com/ceccomp/ceccomp.git\n"
"    cd Ceccomp\n"
"    ./configure --devmode\n"
"    make\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: ../README.md:69
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run Test"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:73
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Run configure and make, then invoke `pytest test` from repo root. Trace pid "
"case will be skipped if no CAP_SYS_ADMIN. If you find some checks failed, "
"please submit an issue to report your case."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../README.md:76
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"To run the test, you need 2 extra packages: `pkgconf` (required by "
"`pkg-config`) and `python-pytest` (required by `pytest`)."
msgstr ""

